Potential Flow Lab @PROJECT_VERSION@
===================================

Interactive 2D potential-flow simulator (ME semester project).

HOW TO RUN
  Double-click PotentialFlowLab.exe. Nothing needs to be installed.

REQUIREMENTS
  - Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit.
  - A graphics driver that supports OpenGL 3.3 (any GPU from roughly 2010 onward
    with up-to-date drivers). Virtual machines and Remote Desktop sessions often
    do not provide OpenGL 3.3; run the program directly on the computer instead.

IF WINDOWS SHOWS "Windows protected your PC"
  The program is not code-signed. Click "More info", then "Run anyway".

CONTROLS (demo build)
  - File > Quit exits the program.
  - The left panel shows the frame rate and the particle settings.
  - "Vortex strength..." opens a dialog: move the slider, then Apply or Cancel.
